' The start screen as it opens with nothing chosen: Extended and the Modern
' opponent, v1.2's defaults. Player one's slot, START, four days, a save.
' Run with `menu seed 7 savefile <f>`; v12_menu_part and v12_menu_resume
' play the same game cut after the first day and resumed in a new process.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 60,104         ' player one's slot
menuclick 163,54         ' START
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
day
wait 10
day
wait 10
day
wait 10
day
wait 10
save
